{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main_0450_water_01",
      "hash": "7439386f7b29a278",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小霞：哎呀，是你！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main_0450_water_02",
      "hash": "74393b6f7b29a791",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "噢～！你战胜了马志士？\\n挺厉害嘛！\\c\\n顺当，顺当！\\n好了，辛苦你了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main_0450_sys_01",
      "hash": "b2b280679438be5e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小霞帮宝可梦\\n恢复了活力！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main_0450_sys_02",
      "hash": "b2b27f679438bcab",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小霞帮宝可梦们\\n恢复了活力！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main_0450_water_03",
      "hash": "74393a6f7b29a5de",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小霞：……我吗？\\n当然是去海水浴咯！\\c\\n我也会有想要离开小泳池\\n到广阔大海里畅游的时候呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main_0450_water_04",
      "hash": "74393d6f7b29aaf7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小霞：你接下来是要去哪呢？\\c\\n不知道你去没去过\\n这附近的地鼠洞穴？\\c\\n还没去过的话，\\n要不要我带你过去？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main_0450_water_05",
      "hash": "74393c6f7b29a944",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真是，\\n居然拒绝人家难得的好意！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main_0450_water_06",
      "hash": "74393f6f7b29ae5d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好吧。那我们走吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main_0450_water_07",
      "hash": "74393e6f7b29acaa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小霞：这里就是地鼠洞穴了！\\c\\n这个洞穴可是\\n地鼠们挖洞前进而形成的哦！\\c\\n那再见啦！\\n要和更多宝可梦相遇哦。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main_0450_water_08",
      "hash": "7439316f7b299693",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0450_max",
      "hash": "0b033ba488b61cca"
    }
  ]
}
